MS teams.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n2. Assumptions / External Interfaces\\\\\\\\n   • Auth Team will expose:\\\\\\\\n        ‑ useAuth() hook → { user, isAuthenticated, isAdmin }\\\\\\\\n        ‑ login(), logout() methods.\\\\\\\\n   • CMS Team will expose REST/GraphQL endpoints for News, Events, Bylaws, etc., plus an Admin Editor URL slug “/admin”.\\\\\\\\n   • Next.js 14+, Tailwind 3+, Headless UI for accessible components.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n3. High-Level Site Map & Navigation Flow\\\\\\\\n   ┌─────────────────────────┐\\\\\\\\n   │   Layout.tsx (Root)     │\\\\\\\\n   └────────────┬────────────┘\\\\\\\\n                ▼\\\\\\\\n   [NavBar]\\\\\\\\n      • Logo → “/”\\\\\\\\n      • About → drop-down (Schools, Bylaws)\\\\\\\\n      • Contact → “/contact”\\\\\\\\n      • News & Events → “/news” (public read)\\\\\\\\n      • Dues → “/dues” (protected)  ⟶ on click → Auth flow → /login if !auth\\\\\\\\n      • Admin → “/admin” (protected admin)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n   [Pages]\\\\\\\\n      /                → HomePage\\\\\\\\n      /schools         → SchoolsPage\\\\\\\\n      /bylaws          → BylawsPage\\\\\\\\n      /contact         → ContactPage (Form)\\\\\\\\n      /news            → NewsEventsList (public read)\\\\\\\\n      /news/[id]       → NewsEventDetail\\\\\\\\n      /dues            → DuesDashboard (member-only)\\\\\\\\n      /meetings        → AnnualMeetings (member-only)\\\\\\\\n      /admin           → AdminShell (admin-only) → CRUD UIs fed by CMS\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n   Footer (persistent) → quick links + social + ADA statement.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n4. Component Hierarchy (condensed)\\\\\\\\n   • RootLayout\\\\\\\\n        ├── NavBar\\\\\\\\n        │     ├── NavLink\\\\\\\\n        │     └── AuthStatusBadge\\\\\\\\n        ├── <Outlet/children>\\\\\\\\n        └── Footer\\\\\\\\n   • Route Guards\\\\\\\\n        ├── ProtectedRoute (requires isAuthenticated)\\\\\\\\n        └── AdminRoute (requires isAdmin)\\\\\\\\n   • UI Library Folder\\\\\\\\n        ├── Button (varian